'''Nekoluganomicon''' (驚愕のネコルガ一族, ''Kyōgaku no Nekoruga Ichizoku'', '''Shocking Nekoluga Clan''') was a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (L): Cats' attack power increases by 20%.

==Combo==
