}}

==Trivia==
*This Combo's name was a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Necronomicon|Necronomicon]]'', a fictional grimoire mentioned in some of [[wikipedia:H. P Lovecraft|H. P. Lovecraft]]'s works.

